### name: re.ambiguity.budget.1
--- note
The ambiguity budget (16): finite choices outside any loop multiply the ways a word can match, and their log2s are summed. Each pair straddles the boundary: the shorter form is accepted, one more is refused.
--- source
RMATCH('(a|a)(a|a)(a|a)(a|a)(a|a)(a|a)(a|a)(a|a)x', "aaaaaaaax")
--- expect
bool TRUE
===

